  "notes": "{凍結|とうけつ} means both physical freezing and figurative suspension.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {凍結|とうけつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to freeze (intransitive/transitive)\n- ⟦{路面|ろめん}→路面：16490_romen⟧{凍結|とうけつ}: road icing\n- ⟦{口座|こうざ}→口座：05419_kouza⟧{凍結|とうけつ}: account freeze\n- ⟦{資産|しさん}→資産：15655_shisan⟧{凍結|とうけつ}: asset freeze\n- ⟦{賃金|ちんぎん}→賃金：04842_chingin⟧{凍結|とうけつ}: wage freeze\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{凍|こお}る→凍る：02100_kooru⟧: to freeze (general, intransitive)\n- {凍結|とうけつ}: freezing (formal, also used figuratively)",
